WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.350
Speaker 1: A judge has ordered armed gunmen
away from ballot drop boxes, but not all the

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:09.130
way away.

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.060
Just 250 feet away.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:17.480
You're allowed to intimidate at ballot drop
boxes in Arizona as long as you do it from

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.199
250 feet away.

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:27.160
If you have been following this story as we
have, we started to see armed.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.170
What do we call them?

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:29.170
They're armed.

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.170
So they are gunmen.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:31.170
Is it a militia?

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.170
I don't know.

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:33.170
Not really.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:40.660
Armed people claiming to be poll watchers
showing up in and around ballot drop boxes

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.920
in Arizona.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:47.180
In some cases, we have video of confrontations
with people just dropping off ballots.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:52.670
Of course, immediately the courts were brought
into this.

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:59.379
And HuffPost and the Associated Press now
report judge orders armed group away from

00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:02.170
Arizona ballot drop boxes.

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:06.970
Local and federal law enforcement have been
alarmed by reports of people, some armed,

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:11.250
watching 24 hour ballot boxes in two counties.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:17.049
And a federal judge yesterday ordered the
armed members of this group to stay at least

00:01:17.049 --> 00:01:24.890
250 feet away from the locations following
complaints that people wearing masks all of

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:30.410
a sudden they want to wear masks and carrying
guns were intimidating voters.

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:31.420
Wow.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:37.759
U.S. District Court Judge Michael Liberti
also said members of Clean Elections USA,

00:01:37.759 --> 00:01:41.820
its leader and anyone working with them are
barred from filming or following anyone within

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:46.820
75 feet of a ballot drop box or the entrance
of a building that houses one.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:52.610
They also can't speak to or yell at people
within that perimeter unless spoken to first.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:55.070
This is insanity.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:58.110
This is absolute and total insanity.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:01.000
Armed people monitoring drop boxes.

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:06.590
It is a dystopian, laughing stock, but we
kind of laugh to avoid crying, which is really

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:07.659
what we should be doing.

00:02:07.659 --> 00:02:08.979
This is horrible.

00:02:08.979 --> 00:02:15.020
This is you know, I don't want to use pejorative
terms, third world stuff or whatever.

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:18.879
This is completely unbecoming of the United
States.

00:02:18.879 --> 00:02:21.940
And by the way, they can be there.

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:25.250
They just have to be 250 feet away.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:29.310
It should have happened sooner and it should
be more than 250 feet.

00:02:29.310 --> 00:02:37.230
Understand that 250 feet in many cases means
that they're allowed to be at the entrance

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:42.160
at this sort of driveway with the parking
lot, I guess you would call it, at the entrance

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:46.830
to the parking lot, to the bit, to the locations
of these ballot drop boxes.

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.989
It doesn't even really change anything.

00:02:48.989 --> 00:02:53.590
Often you have a couple hundred feet, particularly
in Arizona, where things are so spread out

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:55.349
in many parts of the state.

00:02:55.349 --> 00:03:01.800
So instead of seeing them right by the drop
box itself, you see the armed people as you're

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.390
driving in.

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.110
To where you would stop to put your ballots
in.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:12.610
Apparently, the intimidation with guns is
okay and it's free speech as long as you're

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:14.190
250 feet away.

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:17.390
Now, there's a real question here.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:21.070
This has had a chilling effect already.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.840
Is the court decision too late?

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:27.560
Because at the end of the day, they're simply
being told you've got to be a little further

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.910
away.

00:03:28.910 --> 00:03:31.930
And they still might have had the impact that
they want to have.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:34.689
But this should scare all of us.

00:03:34.689 --> 00:03:40.430
And Arizona is the big state in which we've
learned about this happening for now.

00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:43.790
I am monitoring for stories of it happening
in other states.

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.930
And if you come across any, please do let
me know.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:52.849
But this is you know, the court is determining
whether what is being done violates the letter

00:03:52.849 --> 00:03:55.079
of the law.

00:03:55.079 --> 00:03:59.780
What I am more concerned with is that all
of this and this dates back to six months

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:04.640
before the 2020 election, when they started
to hint that if we lose, it's rigged and the

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:11.180
mail in ballots are fraud and all this different
stuff that the spirit of what it should be

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:16.230
to have an election in the United States of
America has, of course, been violated by all

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.420
of this nonsense going all the way back.

